<span class="cat-badge">Guide &middot; Pricing</span>
<h1>Honda Vision vs Honda Air Blade: Hanoi Rental Cost Comparison</h1>
<p>The Honda Vision and the Honda Air Blade rent at the same verified rates in Hanoi at the short end: 200,000 VND per day and 1,000,000 VND per week each. The difference arrives at the month, where the Vision publishes 1,800,000 to 2,000,000 VND, confirmed at the counter as a range, and the Air Blade publishes a single 1,500,000 VND. This comparison reads the two step-up ladders side by side honestly, including the quiet surprise that the fleet's performance machine carries the cheaper month.</p>
<p>We compare the daily, weekly and monthly structures, the break-even logic each ladder produces, what each machine's character actually buys, who each one suits, and the deposit, gear and licensing questions that come with the choice. Start at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental-cost/">Hanoi motorbike rental cost</a> hub, see the full model range at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental/">Hanoi motorbike rental</a> guide, and check common questions on the <a href="/faq/">rental FAQ</a>.</p>
<nav class="toc">
<ol>
<li><a href="#sec-1">The verified price ladders</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-2">Daily rate comparison</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-3">Weekly and monthly comparison</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-4">The break-even logic</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-5">Comfort versus performance</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-6">Who each machine suits</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-7">Deposits, gear and licensing</a></li>
